WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.046 --> 00:00:06.673
"This place scares me," the Tang Monk said.

2
00:00:06.674 --> 00:00:10.549
He and his companions were traveling through a dense forest.

3
00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:13.588
Vines hung from twisted branches.

4
00:00:13.589 --> 00:00:16.603
The leaves up above blocked out the sunlight.

5
00:00:16.604 --> 00:00:20.154
The whole place was dark and spooky.

6
00:00:20.155 --> 00:00:22.207
Wukong waved a hand.

7
00:00:22.208 --> 00:00:28.486
"You worry too much, Master! Nothing here is going to harm you."

8
00:00:28.487 --> 00:00:32.860
"That's right!" Bajie puffed his chest.

9
00:00:32.861 --> 00:00:38.648
"You have us, and—Ouch! A bug bit me!"

10
00:00:38.649 --> 00:00:46.079
Bajie swung his rake as the bug flew away.

11
00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:51.269
Wujing shook his head. "I don't think you worry too much, Master.

12
00:00:51.270 --> 00:00:57.707
There have been many dangers along the way. But we'll keep you safe."

13
00:00:57.708 --> 00:01:04.402
Wukong yawned. "Yes, we'll protect you, Master."

14
00:01:04.403 --> 00:01:06.958
The Tang Monk gave him a funny look.

15
00:01:06.959 --> 00:01:11.338
"Wukong, didn't you get enough sleep last night?"

16
00:01:11.339 --> 00:01:16.554
"I got enough sleep," Wukong said. "I'm just bored."

17
00:01:16.555 --> 00:01:20.006
"How can you be bored?" Wujing asked.

18
00:01:20.007 --> 00:01:25.906
"We just saved Master from a demon yesterday!"

19
00:01:25.907 --> 00:01:29.678
Wukong shrugged. "That was yesterday.

20
00:01:29.679 --> 00:01:35.866
Today is boring so far. And besides, that demon yesterday was dumb.

21
00:01:35.867 --> 00:01:39.988
Fighting him wasn't a real challenge."

22
00:01:39.989 --> 00:01:50.421
Bajie grabbed an apple from a branch. "I happen to like when things are boring."

23
00:01:50.422 --> 00:01:54.836
As everyone laughed, a tree shook gently.

24
00:01:54.837 --> 00:01:58.792
Leaves rustled as several figures hurried along a branch.

25
00:01:58.793 --> 00:02:02.205
Suddenly three small chipmunk demons leaped down.

26
00:02:02.206 --> 00:02:06.010
"The Tang Monk!" one demon said.

27
00:02:06.011 --> 00:02:09.261
Bajie and Wujing drew their weapons.

28
00:02:09.262 --> 00:02:13.773
The Tang Monk shook with fear and fell from his horse.

29
00:02:13.774 --> 00:02:19.616
Wukong chuckled. "Relax, Master."

30
00:02:19.617 --> 00:02:22.827
He took out his iron bar, which quickly grew.

31
00:02:22.828 --> 00:02:26.360
"I'll take care of these silly little demons."

32
00:02:26.361 --> 00:02:30.027
One of the demons raised his head, trying to look tall.

33
00:02:30.028 --> 00:02:32.773
"You're not afraid of us?"

34
00:02:32.774 --> 00:02:40.734
Wukong snorted. "You're tiny!"

35
00:02:40.735 --> 00:02:45.722
"Then why do you need that huge iron bar?" another demon asked.

36
00:02:45.723 --> 00:02:48.433
"Yeah!" the third demon said.

37
00:02:48.434 --> 00:02:56.837
"If you truly weren't afraid of us, you wouldn't need such a big weapon."

38
00:02:56.838 --> 00:03:01.744
"You know what? You're right!" Wukong put the iron bar away.

39
00:03:01.745 --> 00:03:04.975
"In fact, let's make this even more fun.

40
00:03:04.976 --> 00:03:08.727
I'll fight you blindfolded too!"

41
00:03:08.728 --> 00:03:13.173
He took out a cloth and tied it around his head, covering his eyes.

42
00:03:13.174 --> 00:03:16.888
One of the chipmunk demons quickly whispered something.

43
00:03:16.889 --> 00:03:19.719
As he did, a tree moved.

44
00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:24.794
Its branches reached out and grabbed the Tang Monk, Bajie, and Wujing.

45
00:03:24.795 --> 00:03:28.313
Bajie's rake was yanked from his hand.

46
00:03:28.314 --> 00:03:35.286
"Hey—" Bajie tried to cry out, but a branch quickly stuffed leaves into his mouth.

47
00:03:35.287 --> 00:03:39.005
More leaves muffled the voices of the Tang Monk and Wujing.

48
00:03:39.006 --> 00:03:41.835
Another branch grabbed Wujing's spear.

49
00:03:41.836 --> 00:03:45.558
The chipmunk demons chuckled and jumped onto a branch.

50
00:03:45.559 --> 00:03:51.114
Light sparkled, and the tree vanished, along with everyone in it.

51
00:03:51.115 --> 00:03:54.115
"I was wrong, Master," Wukong said.

52
00:03:54.116 --> 00:03:58.990
"Today isn't boring at all!" He turned toward where the demons had been.

53
00:03:58.991 --> 00:04:02.476
"Are you all ready to fight me?"

54
00:04:02.477 --> 00:04:07.909
A light breeze blew through the forest.

55
00:04:07.910 --> 00:04:15.033
Wukong scratched his head. "Hello?" Then he laughed.

56
00:04:15.034 --> 00:04:18.625
"They got scared and ran off! See, Master?

57
00:04:18.626 --> 00:04:23.908
You never have to worry when I'm around . . . Master?"

58
00:04:23.909 --> 00:04:26.315
Wukong ripped off the blindfold.

59
00:04:26.316 --> 00:04:30.238
"Oh no! What happened to my friends—Oof!"

60
00:04:30.239 --> 00:04:37.929
Two more figures appeared out of nowhere and knocked Wukong to the ground.

